1
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:52,600
I've put up with you long enough.

2
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:01,160
- Sarai.
- You must pay for what you did.

3
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:09,320
Please let me go. I'm begging you.

4
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:12,879
Can you help me contact Sarai?

5
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:14,639
There's something I need to ask her.

6
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:16,760
If you're still here,

7
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,400
please give me a sign.

8
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:41,720
Ms. Pakarang,
you're feeling better already?

9
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:47,320
Yes, I'm fine.

10
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,960
Come in.

11
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:08,200
You probably came to visit my father.

12
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:12,759
We were just about to leave.

13
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:14,160
Please, go ahead.

14
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:55,160
I've missed you so much.

15
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:01,520
I never thought

16
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,280
I'd have the chance

17
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:09,960
to hold you again.

18
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,000
I'm happier than I can say.

19
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,200
Hey.

20
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,680
Why did you bring me here?

21
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:59,640
Just follow me.

22
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,320
Are you here to make merit?

23
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,480
Is Venerable Sir here?

24
00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:30,439
Yes.

25
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:33,399
He's in the pavilion.
I can take you there.

26
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:34,400
No need.

27
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,760
It's been a long time, Venerable Sir.

28
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:02,720
As long as karmic ties remain unresolved,

29
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:07,960
people are bound to meet again someday.

30
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,999
Why did you bring me to see a monk?

31
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,080
I didn't come here to listen to a sermon.

32
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:16,440
Take a closer look, Ms. Sairung.

33
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:20,080
You know this monk too.

34
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:43,440
Where's the person
you're introducing me to?

35
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:50,560
Thongdee,

36
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,080
meet Ms. Sairung.

37
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:58,520
You know
what you're supposed to do, right?

38
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:02,080
Yeah. Pong already told me.

39
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,760
Anyway,

40
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,000
just stage the scene, right?

41
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,520
Yes.

42
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:15,000
You only need to pretend
to be my husband's mistress's lover.

43
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:20,239
But if you can't resist and want to...

44
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,240
No.

45
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,639
If I have to actually rape her,

46
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,120
I'm not doing it.

47
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,280
When do we start?

48
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:33,280
Tonight.

49
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,040
Sairung

50
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,960
Finished packing?

51
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:03,680
Yes.

52
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:09,120
Honestly, I never wanted to do this.

53
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,320
I brought you here from the countryside

54
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:16,640
because I wanted
to support your education.

55
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:20,440
You shouldn't have...

56
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,600
I'm sorry.

57
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,840
I was foolish.

58
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,920
Now I understand.

59
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:35,200
To Mr. Phum, I was nothing but a toy.

60
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:39,720
He never wanted me

61
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:44,000
or this child.

62
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:01,640
I'm glad you've come to your senses.

63
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:06,720
When you go home,

64
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:10,280
your father
will take care of you and the baby.

65
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:20,760
Here.

66
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,880
Sairung.

67
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:28,200
I...

68
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:31,240
This is for you.

69
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:34,720
You'll have some money
to raise your child.

70
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,760
Leaving now will be hard for you.

71
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:43,200
I can't accept it, Sairung.

72
00:11:44,920 --> 00:11:46,400
Take it.

73
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:52,600
I don't want to carry
any more guilt than I already do.

74
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:55,480
At least

75
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:58,840
let me do something for my nibling.

76
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:10,040
Take good care of them.

77
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,440
Stop crying.

78
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,840
Drink your milk and get some sleep.

79
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:36,200
You'll need your strength
for the trip tomorrow.

80
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,600
Good luck.

81
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:55,120
Sarai.

82
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:01,560
Sarai.

83
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:10,919
My sleeping pills

84
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:13,840
will keep you
sleeping peacefully until morning.

85
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:18,680
You'll never know
what happened tonight.

86
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:24,720
Come in.

87
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,680
She's pretty.

88
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:47,000
That's why your husband
couldn't get enough of her.

89
00:14:47,520 --> 00:14:48,959
Shut up.

90
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:50,800
I didn't hire you to talk.

91
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:55,560
Just do your job.

92
00:14:56,800 --> 00:14:58,359
Go outside and film it.

93
00:14:58,360 --> 00:15:00,160
Make it look like
a secret recording from the window.

94
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:43,880
Go.

95
00:15:57,240 --> 00:16:00,400
Did you really think
I'd just let you walk away, Sarai?

96
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:03,119
Once Mr. Phum sees this video,

97
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:05,919
even if you crawl back to him someday,

98
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:09,440
he'll never accept
a woman who betrayed him.

99
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,280
Thongdee?

100
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:23,560
You're smart.

101
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:27,360
You became a monk to escape your crimes.

102
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:29,640
Ordination

103
00:16:30,160 --> 00:16:33,360
cannot erase one's sins.

104
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:37,120
Then you can leave the monkhood now.

105
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:40,120
Because we have an important job to do.

106
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:46,760
The person
who sealed Sarai's spirit under the sea

107
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:49,000
was him.

108
00:16:57,640 --> 00:17:01,040
No wonder you brought me here.

109
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:08,079
Right now, her spirit has been released.

110
00:17:08,599 --> 00:17:09,839
I don't know who did it.

111
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,599
It was not anyone else's doing.

112
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,799
All of this was

113
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:20,640
the greed that never knows how to stop

114
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:24,440
or be satisfied within all of you.

115
00:17:27,839 --> 00:17:29,880
What do you mean?

116
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,360
Were you not the one

117
00:17:34,200 --> 00:17:36,040
who sent people to set off an explosion,

118
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:40,560
hoping to obtain the Black Coral
people had been talking about?

119
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:50,320
The Black Coral

120
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:54,079
is the bones and spirit of Sarai,

121
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:58,319
which I sealed with a spell

122
00:17:58,320 --> 00:18:01,640
among the coral reefs
beneath the sea many years ago.

123
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:08,320
The Black Coral is Sarai's bones?

124
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:14,599
Damn it. Why didn't you say that
from the beginning?

125
00:18:14,600 --> 00:18:17,640
I thought it was some rare treasure.

126
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:20,320
Forget that for now.

127
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:23,719
What matters is that right now,

128
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:26,400
her spirit has been released.

129
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:29,160
She has already attacked Ms. Sairung.

130
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:33,520
If you don't hurry and seal her again,

131
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:35,760
the next people she'll attack

132
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,240
is us.

133
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:42,320
You two and I

134
00:18:43,360 --> 00:18:44,999
have already sinned

135
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:47,640
against Sarai more than enough.

136
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,080
Stop this.

137
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:56,160
Let everything follow its karma.

138
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:59,560
She's going to kill me.
How can I just let that happen?

139
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:18,800
Choose.

140
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:22,960
If you don't help us,

141
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,680
you die.

142
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:34,920
You have done enough.

143
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:38,120
Stop now.

144
00:19:42,520 --> 00:19:43,880
Venerable Sir,

145
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:46,120
the SAO officers are here to see you.

146
00:19:51,520 --> 00:19:53,079
Venerable Sir,

147
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:56,160
we came to consult with you
about the major merit-making day.

148
00:19:57,520 --> 00:19:58,560
Mm.

149
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:01,800
Good.

150
00:20:09,600 --> 00:20:11,000
Damn those people.

151
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:15,040
They came in and ruined the timing.

152
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:18,320
What do we do now?

153
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:21,360
If we can't seal Sarai's spirit,

154
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:23,360
she'll kill both of us.

155
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:28,440
Don't worry.

156
00:20:29,280 --> 00:20:32,400
A man like me
doesn't run out of moves that easily.

157
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,640
Are you giving this to me?

158
00:20:55,520 --> 00:20:57,120
It is not mine.

159
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:00,280
It is something that has been
with you since you were little.

160
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,520
Wear it.

161
00:21:21,720 --> 00:21:22,920
Did you find her?

162
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:24,680
No.

163
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:29,160
Mr. Thon,
we've searched several places already.

164
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:49,040
I found her.

165
00:21:51,440 --> 00:21:52,439
Where?

166
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:57,440
- She went that way.
- Then, let's follow her, Ms. Da.

167
00:22:34,960 --> 00:22:36,880
Why are you following me?

168
00:22:41,520 --> 00:22:42,639
Da.

169
00:22:42,640 --> 00:22:46,520
Da, what's wrong?

170
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:49,720
Ms. Da, what happened?

171
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:52,640
It wasn't Sarai.

172
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:56,560
Mr. Thon,

173
00:22:57,600 --> 00:22:59,319
I think we should stop for now.

174
00:22:59,320 --> 00:23:02,920
Searching like this
could put Dara in danger.

175
00:23:07,120 --> 00:23:07,960
Ms. Da,

176
00:23:10,040 --> 00:23:11,160
I'm sorry.

177
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:15,600
I was so focused on finding Sarai
that I forgot to think about your safety.

178
00:23:18,760 --> 00:23:20,040
It's alright.

179
00:23:20,840 --> 00:23:22,240
I'm willing to help.

180
00:23:24,520 --> 00:23:26,840
Na, please take Da back first.

181
00:23:27,720 --> 00:23:28,640
What about you?

182
00:23:29,360 --> 00:23:30,560
I'll take her home myself.

183
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:33,040
Alright then.

184
00:23:34,560 --> 00:23:35,520
Let's go, Da.

185
00:24:07,360 --> 00:24:08,480
Your coffee.

186
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:17,240
You're worried about Dara, aren't you?

187
00:24:19,560 --> 00:24:20,600
I'm terrible.

188
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:23,880
I only thought about my own problem

189
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:27,720
and almost put her in danger.

190
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:32,000
Mr. Mana must feel awful.

191
00:24:33,080 --> 00:24:34,719
Don't think too much.

192
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:38,040
We all understand,
and we're all willing to help you.

193
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:42,880
I don't know how to thank you all enough.

194
00:24:45,360 --> 00:24:46,640
That's easy.

195
00:24:48,960 --> 00:24:49,880
Then,

196
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:51,920
tell me.

197
00:24:53,520 --> 00:24:54,880
Mm.

198
00:24:56,040 --> 00:24:57,240
Smile.

199
00:24:58,600 --> 00:24:59,760
Smile like this.

200
00:25:06,040 --> 00:25:07,880
Look at your face. That's hilarious.

201
00:25:09,800 --> 00:25:13,280
I just found out
you're beautiful and funny.

202
00:25:16,520 --> 00:25:18,320
You're less stressed now, right?

203
00:25:20,840 --> 00:25:23,160
So you were trying to make me laugh.

204
00:25:26,560 --> 00:25:27,880
I'm completely relaxed now.

205
00:25:29,600 --> 00:25:33,760
Then try smiling like me.

206
00:25:35,800 --> 00:25:36,960
Is that a good idea?

207
00:25:41,280 --> 00:25:42,360
Do it.

208
00:25:42,880 --> 00:25:44,200
Like this.

209
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,400
That's cute.

210
00:26:01,160 --> 00:26:02,480
I don't recognize this number.

211
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:06,160
Hello.

212
00:26:08,160 --> 00:26:09,160
Venerable Sir?

213
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:14,960
Yes, Venerable Sir.

214
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:19,000
When would you like me to come see you?

215
00:26:22,680 --> 00:26:23,680
Sure.

216
00:26:29,160 --> 00:26:31,640
Venerable Sir said he wants to talk.

217
00:26:32,160 --> 00:26:33,760
What is it about?

218
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:36,520
I have no clue.

219
00:26:38,360 --> 00:26:40,960
When will you go see him?

220
00:26:41,560 --> 00:26:43,840
I'll probably wait
until my father wakes up.

221
00:26:45,320 --> 00:26:47,680
I don't want to leave him right now.

222
00:27:09,040 --> 00:27:10,400
How much farther?

223
00:27:11,960 --> 00:27:13,680
Just drive where I tell you.

224
00:27:14,360 --> 00:27:15,520
Stop asking questions.

225
00:27:17,520 --> 00:27:19,160
Who are you taking me to see?

226
00:27:20,520 --> 00:27:21,560
You'll know soon enough.

227
00:27:23,720 --> 00:27:26,640
<i>Just wait until I deal with Sarai first.</i>

228
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:30,120
<i>I won't let someone like you
order me around.</i>

229
00:27:49,440 --> 00:27:52,280
Ms. Pakarang
seems very worried about Mr. Phum.

230
00:27:58,800 --> 00:28:00,320
I never thought

231
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:03,240
an outsider like Ms. Pakarang

232
00:28:04,360 --> 00:28:05,920
would care about my father this much.

233
00:28:09,040 --> 00:28:10,000
Actually,

234
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:15,000
the person
who should be by his side right now

235
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:18,440
is the woman known as his wife.

236
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:30,200
It's strange.

237
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:33,040
The more I look at Pakarang,

238
00:28:37,080 --> 00:28:39,640
the more I feel that
she has something so similar to...

239
00:28:41,280 --> 00:28:42,360
Sarai.

240
00:28:49,080 --> 00:28:50,400
You must be tired.

241
00:28:51,640 --> 00:28:53,760
I should take you home.

242
00:28:54,440 --> 00:28:57,680
Pakarang is here to take care
of my father, so I don't have to worry.

243
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,240
Shall we go?

244
00:29:11,560 --> 00:29:13,120
Mr. Phum,

245
00:29:16,600 --> 00:29:18,720
when will you wake up?

246
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:22,280
Mr. Phum.

247
00:29:43,280 --> 00:29:44,480
Pakarang.

248
00:29:51,360 --> 00:29:54,200
We're going to the hospital.
Stay with me, Pakarang.

249
00:29:58,000 --> 00:29:59,600
You must die.

250
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,280
Sarai.

251
00:30:14,040 --> 00:30:15,920
Take a better look at me.

252
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,600
Sarai...

253
00:30:28,640 --> 00:30:29,960
How is this possible?

254
00:30:35,760 --> 00:30:37,520
Don't be afraid of me.

255
00:30:38,960 --> 00:30:40,320
I promise

256
00:30:42,160 --> 00:30:44,080
I won't hurt you again.

257
00:30:48,400 --> 00:30:49,360
Am I

258
00:30:50,920 --> 00:30:52,760
still dreaming?

259
00:30:54,720 --> 00:30:56,560
This isn't real.

260
00:30:58,680 --> 00:31:00,400
How is it possible?

261
00:31:01,080 --> 00:31:02,720
You and Pakarang...

262
00:31:03,800 --> 00:31:05,320
You're in the same body.

263
00:31:08,600 --> 00:31:10,040
But it has already happened.

264
00:31:12,560 --> 00:31:14,280
Listen to me carefully.

265
00:31:20,440 --> 00:31:21,480
Sir.

266
00:31:22,760 --> 00:31:25,239
Don't try. She's dead.

267
00:31:25,240 --> 00:31:26,480
She won't make it.

268
00:31:36,880 --> 00:31:39,440
She's awake!

269
00:31:42,600 --> 00:31:46,560
I've been inside Pakarang's body
since that day.

270
00:31:51,840 --> 00:31:53,280
Now I understand

271
00:31:54,400 --> 00:31:57,240
why I felt that way about Pakarang

272
00:31:58,400 --> 00:32:01,720
even though I never thought
I could love anyone again

273
00:32:02,920 --> 00:32:04,480
except you, Sarai.

274
00:32:05,080 --> 00:32:06,400
Mr. Phum.

275
00:32:40,600 --> 00:32:43,080
- This house?
- Yes.

276
00:32:44,160 --> 00:32:46,560
My ex-employee Piak
used to live around here.

277
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:49,879
He said
there's a powerful master named Kong

278
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:51,600
who's good at subduing ghosts.

279
00:33:02,360 --> 00:33:03,360
Master Kong.

280
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:06,280
Is Master Kong here?

281
00:33:09,800 --> 00:33:12,440
Ugh. The house is silent.

282
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:16,040
Master Kong.

283
00:33:17,200 --> 00:33:19,600
Father isn't here. Go back.

284
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:21,559
Are you crazy?

285
00:33:21,560 --> 00:33:24,440
I drove all this way,
and you're telling me to go back?

286
00:33:25,280 --> 00:33:27,040
If he isn't here, I'll wait.

287
00:33:27,560 --> 00:33:29,240
Go back!

288
00:33:32,280 --> 00:33:35,239
You crazy kid. Do you know who I am?

289
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:37,640
I'm bringing work for your father.

290
00:33:38,440 --> 00:33:39,640
Leave!

291
00:33:42,840 --> 00:33:44,080
A ghost!

292
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:47,880
Ms. Sairung.

293
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:56,720
I'm sorry

294
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:01,640
for hurting you and nearly killing you.

295
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:08,320
Why did you want to kill me?

296
00:34:12,960 --> 00:34:14,560
Because I misunderstood.

297
00:34:18,400 --> 00:34:20,000
I thought

298
00:34:21,520 --> 00:34:24,679
you sent those three criminals to kill me.

299
00:34:27,280 --> 00:34:28,440
Kill you?

300
00:34:31,080 --> 00:34:32,199
How?

301
00:34:33,360 --> 00:34:35,199
What happened?

302
00:34:50,840 --> 00:34:52,319
Please. I'm begging you.

303
00:34:52,320 --> 00:34:53,440
Please.

304
00:34:54,280 --> 00:34:55,760
My child.

305
00:34:56,880 --> 00:34:58,719
My child.

306
00:34:58,720 --> 00:35:01,279
Don't hurt my child, please.

307
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:03,959
Please don't hurt me and my child.
I'm begging you.

308
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:06,120
Please let me go. Please.

309
00:35:07,920 --> 00:35:09,279
Shut up!

310
00:35:09,280 --> 00:35:12,159
I don't have money or anything valuable.

311
00:35:12,160 --> 00:35:14,640
I'm just an ordinary villager.
Please let me go.

312
00:35:15,960 --> 00:35:18,159
That's why we're making you
lead us to the treasure.

313
00:35:18,160 --> 00:35:21,520
What are you talking about?
I don't understand.

314
00:35:22,280 --> 00:35:25,239
I just want you
to lead us to Skull Island.

315
00:35:25,240 --> 00:35:29,280
If you take us there, I'll bring you back.

316
00:35:30,440 --> 00:35:32,999
Please don't hurt me and my child.

317
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:34,840
- Don't hurt my child.
- Take her.

318
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:37,680
- My child.
- Go.

319
00:35:39,200 --> 00:35:40,519
My child.

320
00:35:40,520 --> 00:35:43,400
- My child.
- Don't struggle.

321
00:35:49,080 --> 00:35:50,400
Let's go.

322
00:36:21,240 --> 00:36:23,880
Hey. Is that Skull Island?

323
00:36:25,960 --> 00:36:27,320
Yes.

324
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:29,400
That's the island.

325
00:36:35,720 --> 00:36:37,320
- Let go of me.
- Hey!

326
00:36:38,120 --> 00:36:40,639
- Let go.
- You brat.

327
00:36:40,640 --> 00:36:43,040
Are you trying to run away?

328
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:44,999
Hey.

329
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:47,759
- Enough.
- I'm begging you.

330
00:36:47,760 --> 00:36:49,879
Please let me go.
I don't want to go there.

331
00:36:49,880 --> 00:36:52,399
Please let me go back to my child.

332
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:54,519
I'm begging you. Please.

333
00:36:54,520 --> 00:36:56,240
Go back to your child?

334
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:01,520
- No!
- What are you doing?

335
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:04,520
No!

336
00:37:06,840 --> 00:37:09,520
Please help me. No.

337
00:37:10,440 --> 00:37:11,359
- No.
- Stop!

338
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:14,040
- What are you doing?
- Just stay out of this.

339
00:37:16,800 --> 00:37:18,200
You're so tough, huh?

340
00:37:19,560 --> 00:37:21,320
Help me.

341
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:23,679
How is it?

342
00:37:23,680 --> 00:37:26,719
Go on, jump now.

343
00:37:26,720 --> 00:37:29,319
If you jump again,
you'll sink to the bottom of the sea.

344
00:37:29,320 --> 00:37:30,880
Go ahead. Dare to?

345
00:37:31,800 --> 00:37:33,880
Good.

346
00:37:35,040 --> 00:37:36,520
Now we don't have to keep watching her.

347
00:37:37,440 --> 00:37:38,280
That's it.

348
00:37:47,240 --> 00:37:48,120
Hey.

349
00:37:49,200 --> 00:37:50,320
We're screwed.

350
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:52,120
There's a boat coming this way.

351
00:37:56,200 --> 00:37:58,359
- Help me!
- Hey!

352
00:37:58,360 --> 00:38:00,439
- Where are you going?
- Help me!

353
00:38:00,440 --> 00:38:02,599
- Help me!
- Hey.

354
00:38:02,600 --> 00:38:04,239
- Don't.
- Let go!

355
00:38:04,240 --> 00:38:05,520
- Don't.
- Stop!

356
00:38:06,160 --> 00:38:07,240
Don't.

357
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:11,120
Hey, don't. Pong!

358
00:38:14,960 --> 00:38:16,280
We're screwed.

359
00:38:20,240 --> 00:38:21,760
What have you done, Pong?!

360
00:38:30,440 --> 00:38:31,480
It's alright.

361
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:34,080
At least we know where the island is.

362
00:39:17,560 --> 00:39:20,720
I never imagined you had to
go through something that terrible.

363
00:39:24,720 --> 00:39:26,080
Who were they?

364
00:39:32,080 --> 00:39:34,160
I never imagined either

365
00:39:35,960 --> 00:39:38,840
that the person I respected
like my own sister

366
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:43,360
could be so cruel to me.

367
00:39:47,720 --> 00:39:48,840
You mean...

368
00:39:52,200 --> 00:39:53,120
Yes.

369
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:55,240
Sairung

370
00:39:56,560 --> 00:39:58,440
was behind everything.

371
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:18,240
Hey.

372
00:40:18,920 --> 00:40:20,160
What do we do next?

373
00:40:22,920 --> 00:40:26,400
We wait until morning and go back.

374
00:40:29,240 --> 00:40:31,719
If you hadn't run your mouth
and insulted that ghost kid,

375
00:40:31,720 --> 00:40:33,599
we wouldn't be in trouble.

376
00:40:33,600 --> 00:40:36,880
He must be a spirit child
raised by Master Kong.

377
00:40:37,920 --> 00:40:41,160
How was I supposed to know
that kid wasn't a human?

378
00:40:44,240 --> 00:40:45,360
This is all because of you people.

379
00:40:46,040 --> 00:40:47,719
What kind of spirit-binding did you do?

380
00:40:47,720 --> 00:40:49,400
How did Sarai break free
and come back to attack us?

381
00:40:52,240 --> 00:40:54,720
Thongdee already performed the spell.

382
00:40:55,480 --> 00:40:57,519
You should be asking your people.

383
00:40:57,520 --> 00:40:59,719
How did they blast the coral

384
00:40:59,720 --> 00:41:01,600
and cause Sarai's spirit to break free?

385
00:41:03,080 --> 00:41:04,680
Whatever happened, she's free now.

386
00:41:08,880 --> 00:41:13,440
We have to get her spirit back
where it belongs within three days.

387
00:41:14,560 --> 00:41:16,040
Why three days?

388
00:41:16,960 --> 00:41:18,879
I promised her

389
00:41:18,880 --> 00:41:21,280
I'd find her child within three days.

390
00:41:24,520 --> 00:41:25,880
So,

391
00:41:26,680 --> 00:41:28,160
is her child alive or dead?

392
00:41:33,000 --> 00:41:34,360
Who knows?

393
00:41:47,000 --> 00:41:51,360
Why would Sairung
still send people to hurt you

394
00:41:52,120 --> 00:41:55,360
when you had already left
with another man?

395
00:42:00,440 --> 00:42:01,960
Another man?

396
00:42:05,600 --> 00:42:07,640
What are you talking about?

397
00:42:10,880 --> 00:42:13,240
After I returned to Thailand,

398
00:42:14,960 --> 00:42:17,560
Sairung told me you had left the house...

399
00:42:19,320 --> 00:42:21,040
with your lover.

400
00:42:23,480 --> 00:42:24,440
Sarai.

401
00:42:25,480 --> 00:42:26,760
The moment you got home,

402
00:42:27,280 --> 00:42:30,480
you came straight to see Sarai,
Mr. Phum?

403
00:42:38,200 --> 00:42:39,880
You even brought her a gift.

404
00:42:40,840 --> 00:42:42,320
What a pity.

405
00:42:42,920 --> 00:42:44,240
She'll never get to use it.

406
00:42:45,720 --> 00:42:46,920
Where is Sarai?

407
00:42:48,880 --> 00:42:51,360
I'm asking you, where is Sarai?

408
00:42:53,400 --> 00:42:55,160
She's gone.

409
00:42:56,920 --> 00:42:58,320
You drove her away, didn't you?

410
00:42:58,960 --> 00:43:00,280
Didn't you?

411
00:43:00,800 --> 00:43:02,559
She ran away with her lover.

412
00:43:02,560 --> 00:43:03,920
I don't believe you.

413
00:43:15,880 --> 00:43:18,120
Sarai, you're evil.

414
00:43:19,400 --> 00:43:20,600
You shameless woman.

415
00:43:35,320 --> 00:43:37,720
So everything was Sairung's plan.

416
00:43:41,560 --> 00:43:43,680
She wanted you to hate me

417
00:43:45,760 --> 00:43:46,920
and hate our child.

418
00:43:50,760 --> 00:43:51,760
Child?

419
00:43:53,480 --> 00:43:55,560
What do you mean?

420
00:43:58,720 --> 00:44:01,280
When I left your house,

421
00:44:02,520 --> 00:44:04,759
I was three months' pregnant.

422
00:44:04,760 --> 00:44:06,800
Then why didn't you tell me?

423
00:44:09,680 --> 00:44:11,440
I did tell you once,

424
00:44:12,720 --> 00:44:15,520
but you said you didn't want me
to get pregnant yet.

425
00:44:16,680 --> 00:44:18,000
So I thought

426
00:44:19,760 --> 00:44:23,960
you didn't truly love me,
and that you didn't want our child.

427
00:44:24,480 --> 00:44:27,800
That's why I forced myself to leave you,

428
00:44:28,760 --> 00:44:30,600
just as Sairung ordered.

429
00:44:31,800 --> 00:44:33,520
You misunderstood everything.

430
00:44:37,800 --> 00:44:42,120
I did that
because I wanted to keep you safe.

431
00:44:43,560 --> 00:44:46,040
I promised Sairung

432
00:44:47,120 --> 00:44:49,760
that I would never have a child
with anyone after she miscarried.

433
00:44:54,720 --> 00:44:56,920
Was our child a girl or a boy?

434
00:44:58,840 --> 00:45:00,280
A boy.

435
00:45:02,640 --> 00:45:04,280
Then where is he now?

436
00:45:09,720 --> 00:45:13,360
Since that night, I haven't known...

437
00:45:14,720 --> 00:45:17,000
whether our son is alive or dead.

438
00:45:41,080 --> 00:45:45,639
If you can get rid of her,
name your price. I'll pay anything.

439
00:45:45,640 --> 00:45:47,719
With that kind of money,

440
00:45:47,720 --> 00:45:49,119
that Sarai ghost

441
00:45:49,120 --> 00:45:50,960
will be sent back
where she belongs in no time.

442
00:45:56,640 --> 00:46:00,239
I guess it really is time for us
to say goodbye, Mr. Phum.

443
00:46:00,240 --> 00:46:01,599
<i>Ms. Sarai,</i>

444
00:46:01,600 --> 00:46:03,160
are you in this room?

445
00:46:35,560 --> 00:46:37,800
Subtitle translation by: Panuwat Baikeawon
